Package: Directionalkernel
Type: Package
Title: Kernel Related Functions for Directional Data
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-11-16
Authors@R: person("Michail", "Tsagris", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mtsagris@uoc.gr")
Author: Michail Tsagris [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Michail Tsagris <mtsagris@uoc.gr>
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: graphics, kernreg, Rcpp, Rfast, stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: Directional, circda, Rfast2
Description: Functions to perform kernel density estimation, kernel discriminant analysis, and kernel regression with circular or (hyper-)spherical data. The references include: Taylor C. C. (2008) <doi:10.1016/j.csda.2007.11.003>, and Garcia Portugues E. (2013) <doi:10.1214/13-EJS821>.   
